      "translationRaw": "Youaregone。Theriverishighatmydoor。Cicadasaremuteondew-ladenboughs。Thisisamomentwhenthoughtsenterdeep。Istandaloneforalongwhile。。。。TheNorthStarisnearertomenowthanspring，Andcouriersfromyoursouthlandneverarrive--YetIdoubtmydreamonthefarhorizonThatyouhavefoundanotherfriend。",
